# File: attacker/sshd_config
# Author: Team LARP
# Revision date: 2026-11-12
# Version: 0.1.0
# Purpose: Key-only sshd policy for the attacker/probe host.

Port 22
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PermitRootLogin no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PrintMotd no
UseDNS no
LogLevel VERBOSE
AllowUsers probe
